   "source": [
    "Existen diversas formas de obtener datos de Twitter para su análisis. Una de las formas más recomendadas es utilizar el API oficial de la plataforma. Sin embargo, el API tiene una limitación importante: no permite recuperar tweets más allá de una ventana de una semana. En estas circunstancias, se recurre a técnicas de web scraping."
   ]
  },
    {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<h2>Entender el URL</h2>\n",
    "El URL que vamos a utilizar para la busqueda se compone de varios elementos que especifican la ubicación y los parámetros de la búsqueda en Twitter."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "url = 'https://twitter.com/search?q=facebook&src=typed_query'\n",
    "response = requests.get(url)\n",
    "print(response.text)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Twitter emplea una página web dinámica para presentar su contenido. Selenium es una herramienta muy útil cuando se trata de realizar web scraping en páginas web dinámicas como Twitter."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def scrapper(url):\n",
    "    # Configuración de las opciones de Selenium para Google Colab\n",
    "    chrome_options = webdriver.ChromeOptions()\n",
    "    chrome_options.add_argument('--headless')\n",
    "    chrome_options.add_argument('--no-sandbox')\n",
    "    chrome_options.add_argument('--disable-dev-shm-usage')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Inicializa el driver de Chrome con las opciones para Colab\n",
    "    driver = webdriver.Chrome(options=chrome_options)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    data = {}\n",
    "    \n",
    "    driver.get(url)\n",
    "    time.sleep(3)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    resp = driver.page_source\n",
    "    driver.quit()\n",
    "    \n",
    "    soup = BeautifulSoup(resp, 'html.parser')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        profile_name_container = soup.find('div', {'data-testid': 'UserName'})\n",
    "        data[\"profile_name\"] = profile_name_container.find('span').text\n",
    "    except Exception as e:\n",
    "        data[\"profile_name\"] = None\n",
    "        \n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        data[\"profile_handle\"] = profile_name_container.find_all('span')[2].text\n",
    "    except Exception as e:\n",
    "        data[\"profile_handle\"] = None\n",
    "        \n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        data[\"profile_bio\"] = soup.find(\"div\", {\"data-testid\": \"UserDescription\"}).text\n",
    "    except Exception as e:\n",
    "        data[\"profile_bio\"] = None\n",
    "        \n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        following_element = soup.find('a', href=lambda href: href and '/following' in href)\n",
    "        data[\"profile_following\"] = following_element.find('span').text + ' Following'\n",
    "    except Exception as e:\n",
    "        data[\"profile_following\"] = None\n",
    "        \n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        followers_element = soup.find('a', href=lambda href: href and '/verified_followers' in href)\n",
    "        data[\"profile_followers\"] = followers_element.find('span').text + ' Followers'\n",
    "    except Exception as e:\n",
    "        data[\"profile_followers\"] = None\n",
    "\n",
    "    data[\"profile_category\"] = None\n",
    "    data[\"profile_website\"] = None\n",
    "    data[\"profile_joining_date\"] = None\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return data\n",
    "\n",
    "target_url = \"https://twitter.com/facebook\"\n",
    "print(scrapper(target_url))"
   ]
  },
